        "@value": "The tax expenditure statement shall be used for the purpose of assessing revenue foregone arising from changes in the tax policy of the Government, including but not limited to exemption, remission, allowance, preferential tax rate, deferral or offset, that reduces tax obligation to achieve its intended objective."
      }
    },
